{26} When Nuh saw that his supplication was of no benefit to them except to make them flee, {He said: My Lord, help me, for they have denied me}: he sought his Lord's help against them, out of zeal for God, since they neglected His command and denied His messengers. And he said: {My Lord, do not leave upon the earth from among the disbelievers an inhabitant. Indeed, if You leave them, they will mislead Your servants and will beget none but wicked disbelievers.} God Almighty said: {And Nuh had certainly called Us, and We are the best of responders.}

